<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4533" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		aurum. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>pertaining to gold</i>,
				<i>golden</i>, <i>gold-</i>:
			statera, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. p. 455, 21</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">metalla,</span>”
				<i>gold-mines</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 12, 74, § 193</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fornax,</span>”
				<i>for smelting gold</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					34, 13, 34, § 132</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">negotium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 2, 2, 51</span></i>
			: canon, <i>a tax upon purchase and sale</i>,
			Cod. 10, 47, 10; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auraria pensitatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 11, 61, 2</span></i>
			; and <i>absol.</i> auraria,
				<i><span class="en">ib. 12, 6, 29</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurārĭ-us</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a worker in
				gold</i>, <i>a goldsmith</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			3096</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurārĭa</span></b> ,
				ae, f.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b> (Sc. fodina.) <i>A gold-mine</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 6,
			19</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>A female worker in gold</i>, or <i>a
				golddealer</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			4065</span></i> (v. Orell. ad h. l.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
